* The lab lift (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own script and our own art
* from art/lift.py; owner, 2026-11-08, redrawn 2026-11-09 as a
* modern glass pod). The pod (vehicle 3 2 141, sprite zlft, a PNG with real
* transparency) runs centred in the copper shaft of the domed lab (inside
* x 4247-4339; the pod is 90 wide at x 4248) between three stops, each
* level with a floor beside it:
*   stop 0  the lab floor          y 1544  (room 32)
*   stop 1  the right platform     y 1739  (rooms 35/36)
*   stop 2  the left platform      y 1858  (room 33)
* The pod's floor is 102 px below its top, so its top sits at 1442, 1637 and
* 1756. Like the game's lifts, activate 1 takes it down a stop and activate
* 2 up a stop, gathering the creatures inside on the way and setting them
* down on arrival. A caller (2 2 216-218, sprite zlbt) at each stop brings it
* there. OV00 the stop it is at (or left), OV01 the stop it is going to, OV02
* 1 while moving.
* The pod is four parts on one sprite: 1 the far glass (plane 1399) and 0
* the floor (1400), behind creatures; riders are drawn at 1401 (CABP, which
* openc2e allows in C2 for this; a C2 vehicle's riders are otherwise drawn
* at plane 1, behind nearly everything); then 2 the near glass (1450, a
* faint tint and soft reflections) and 3 the top housing and base with their
* light lines (1451; picture 0 dim, 1 bright while moving), in front of its
* riders but behind creatures walking past (1500): at 1600 the pod hid the
* creatures on the lab floor in front of it (owner, 2026-11-19). A creature
* standing in the pod at a stop is drawn as any walker. Parts 2 and 3 are
* click-through
* (TRAN, which openc2e allows in C2 for this), so a creature inside can
* still be clicked. Run by openc2e after the world loads (Additions folder);
* made anew each load.

* The right platform's floor (room 35, y 1739) ran on west of the shaft
* over the left balcony (room 33, 1858) to the dome's west wall, joining the
* walkway from the west (room 51): creatures walked across in mid-air and
* through the shaft to the right platform (owner, 2026-11-19, night: they
* should meet a wall at the shaft's left side). Room 35 now ends at x 4225,
* by the shaft's left side, short of the pod at 4248 (a creature against a
* wall stands up to about 20 px into it, and the pod would sweep up one
* touching it); the shaft's column at that level is room 255 (35's values),
* open to the right platform (36) and walled from 35. ROOM takes all of a
* room's data, so each room's own values are passed back. Copy test: three
* creatures walked east at the wall from over the balcony for 45 s; none
* got past it (furthest right edge x 4199).
room 35 3917 1544 4225 1739 room 35 4 room 35 5 room 35 6 room 35 7 room 35 8 room 35 9 room 35 12 room 35 13 room 35 14 room 35 15 room 35 16 room 35 17 room 35 19
room 255 4225 1544 4349 1739 room 35 4 room 35 5 room 35 6 room 35 7 room 35 8 room 35 9 room 35 12 room 35 13 room 35 14 room 35 15 room 35 16 room 35 17 room 35 19
setv door 0 35 255 0
setv door 0 255 36 255
setv door 0 255 32 100
setv door 0 255 33 100
setv door 0 35 36 0

enum 3 2 141 kill targ next
* The callers are 25 x 75 (25% bigger than first drawn, owner 2026-11-09:
* they read small beside similar devices), each kept centred where it was.
enum 2 2 216 kill targ next
enum 2 2 217 kill targ next
enum 2 2 218 kill targ next
enum 2 1 144 kill targ next
enum 2 1 145 kill targ next
enum 2 1 146 kill targ next

* The sprite's pictures: 0 the floor, 1 the far glass, 2-7 the near glass
* with its sliding doors from closed (2) to open (7), 8 and 9 the housing and
* base with lights dim and bright.
inst
new: vhcl zlft 10 0
setv cls2 3 2 141
new: part 0 0 0 0 1400
new: part 1 0 0 1 1399
new: part 2 0 0 2 1450
new: part 3 0 0 8 1451
tran 1 2
tran 1 3
part 2 pose 5
part 0
cabp 1401
cabn 6 16 84 102
setv attr 4
bhvr 0 0
setv ov00 1 setv ov01 1 setv ov02 0 setv ov03 0 setv ov04 5 setv ov05 0
mvto 4248 1637
tick 1
slow

* OV02 the state: 0 waiting with its doors open, 1 closing its doors, 2
* moving, 3 opening its doors. OV04 the doors' picture, 0 closed to 5 open.
* A trip: the doors slide shut (5 ticks), the creatures inside are gathered
* (gpas), the pod rides, the doors slide open and the riders are set down
* (dpas).

* down a stop
scrp 3 2 141 1
  doif ov02 eq 0
    doif ov00 lt 2
      setv ov01 ov00 addv ov01 1
      setv ov02 1 snde ding
    endi
  endi
  setv actv 0
endm
* up a stop
scrp 3 2 141 2
  doif ov02 eq 0
    doif ov00 gt 0
      setv ov01 ov00 subv ov01 1
      setv ov02 1 snde ding
    endi
  endi
  setv actv 0
endm
scrp 3 2 141 0
  setv actv 0
endm

* every tick (all at once: INST, since a C2 script otherwise runs only a few
* steps a tick). Moving: speeds up by 4 px a tick to 30 and brakes as evenly
* into the stop (the speed from which braking by 4 a tick stops in the
* distance left: the whole-number square root of 8 x distance, at least 2).
* OV03 the current speed. (openc2e draws vehicles and riders gliding
* between ticks, so the steps don't show.)
scrp 3 2 141 9
  inst
  * the iris at the top of the shaft opens while the pod is in it or above
  * it (its top above y 1578), or is setting off for the lab floor, and
  * shuts once the pod has gone down past it: OV05 its picture, 0 shut to
  * 6 open, a step a tick
  setv var8 0
  doif post lt 1578 setv var8 1 endi
  doif ov02 gt 0 doif ov02 lt 3 doif ov01 eq 0 setv var8 1 endi endi endi
  doif var8 eq 1
    doif ov05 lt 6 addv ov05 1 endi
  else
    doif ov05 gt 0 subv ov05 1 endi
  endi
  setv var9 ov05
  enum 2 1 145 part 0 pose var9 next
  doif ov02 eq 3
    addv ov04 1
    doif ov04 ge 5
      setv ov04 5
      dpas
      setv ov02 0 part 3 pose 0
    endi
    part 2 pose ov04
    stop
  endi
  doif ov02 eq 1
    subv ov04 1
    doif ov04 le 0
      setv ov04 0
      gpas
      setv ov02 2 part 3 pose 1
    endi
    part 2 pose ov04
    stop
  endi
  doif ov02 eq 2
    setv var0 1442
    doif ov01 eq 1 setv var0 1637 endi
    doif ov01 eq 2 setv var0 1756 endi
    setv var1 var0 subv var1 post
    setv var2 var1
    doif var2 lt 0 negv var2 endi
    addv ov03 4
    doif ov03 gt 30 setv ov03 30 endi
    setv var7 var2 mulv var7 8
    setv var3 0
    reps 31
      setv var6 var3 addv var6 1 mulv var6 var6
      doif var6 le var7 addv var3 1 endi
    repe
    doif var3 lt 2 setv var3 2 endi
    doif ov03 gt var3 setv ov03 var3 endi
    doif var2 gt ov03
      setv var4 ov03
      doif var1 lt 0 negv var4 endi
      mvby 0 var4
    else
      mvto 4248 var0
      setv ov00 ov01 setv ov02 3 setv ov03 0
    endi
  endi
endm

* the callers: each brings the lift to its own stop
scrp 2 2 216 1
  pose 1 snde ding
  enum 3 2 141 doif ov02 eq 0 doif ov00 ne 0 setv ov01 0 setv ov02 1 endi endi next
  part 0 wait 30 pose 0 setv actv 0
endm
scrp 2 2 216 2
  pose 1 snde ding
  enum 3 2 141 doif ov02 eq 0 doif ov00 ne 0 setv ov01 0 setv ov02 1 endi endi next
  part 0 wait 30 pose 0 setv actv 0
endm
scrp 2 2 217 1
  pose 1 snde ding
  enum 3 2 141 doif ov02 eq 0 doif ov00 ne 1 setv ov01 1 setv ov02 1 endi endi next
  part 0 wait 30 pose 0 setv actv 0
endm
scrp 2 2 217 2
  pose 1 snde ding
  enum 3 2 141 doif ov02 eq 0 doif ov00 ne 1 setv ov01 1 setv ov02 1 endi endi next
  part 0 wait 30 pose 0 setv actv 0
endm
scrp 2 2 218 1
  pose 1 snde ding
  enum 3 2 141 doif ov02 eq 0 doif ov00 ne 2 setv ov01 2 setv ov02 1 endi endi next
  part 0 wait 30 pose 0 setv actv 0
endm
scrp 2 2 218 2
  pose 1 snde ding
  enum 3 2 141 doif ov02 eq 0 doif ov00 ne 2 setv ov01 2 setv ov02 1 endi endi next
  part 0 wait 30 pose 0 setv actv 0
endm

* The iris at the top of the shaft (art/iris.py, sprite zlir):
* a machined collar of worn brushed steel and bronze, seen about 4 degrees
* from above, over the stone lintel (x 4249-4338, y 1543-1571) whose
* top is a ring of eight blades. Its back (2 1 145, pictures 0-6, shut to
* open, plane 1390) is behind the pod; its front (2 1 146, picture 7, the
* ring's near half and the collar's face, plane 1610) is in front of it, so
* the pod passes through the ring. Both click-through. The lab floor over
* the shaft is solid in the map (door 32-35, permeability 100), as the
* shut iris shows; the pod, a vehicle, goes through it.
inst new: simp zlir 7 0 1390 0 setv cls2 2 1 145 setv attr 0 tran 1 0 pose 0 mvto 4245 1538 slow
inst new: simp zlir 1 7 1610 0 setv cls2 2 1 146 setv attr 0 tran 1 0 pose 0 mvto 4245 1538 slow

* the callers: modern call pillars, on the lab floor right of the shaft,
* and on the two platforms standing behind the railings (behind creatures,
* plane 1300), with the bits of railing that pass in front of them (2 1 144,
* sprite zlrl, plane 1310, click-through)
inst new: simp zlbt 2 0 1300 0 setv cls2 2 2 216 setv attr 4 bhvr 2 0 pose 0 mvto 4353 1469 slow
inst new: simp zlbt 2 0 1300 0 setv cls2 2 2 217 setv attr 4 bhvr 2 0 pose 0 mvto 4445 1664 slow
inst new: simp zlbt 2 0 1300 0 setv cls2 2 2 218 setv attr 4 bhvr 2 0 pose 0 mvto 4145 1783 slow
inst new: simp zlrl 2 0 1310 0 setv cls2 2 1 144 setv attr 0 tran 1 0 pose 0 mvto 4445 1664 slow
inst new: simp zlrl 2 0 1310 0 setv cls2 2 1 144 setv attr 0 tran 1 0 pose 1 mvto 4145 1783 slow
